IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PERF-ARITH-TIMES.

DATA DIVISION.
01 COUNTER PICTURE IS 9(3).
01 TOTAL PICTURE IS 9(3).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 0 TO COUNTER.
    MOVE 0 TO TOTAL.
    PERFORM ADDONE 5 TIMES.
    PERFORM ADDONE THROUGH ADDTHREE 3 TIMES.
    DISPLAY COUNTER.
    DISPLAY TOTAL.

ADDONE.
    ADD 1 TO COUNTER.

ADDTHREE.
    ADD 3 TO TOTAL.